VERSION "MFE26 real-VCU HIL / CarMaker two-bus contract"

CM_ "CAN topology: two independent buses, Speedgoat the only node on both. Channel 2 / IO614 Port A is the VC bus (control frames 390/406/422/438 VC->SpeedgoatHIL; the nine inverter status frames and the MTi/LWS sensor frames SpeedgoatHIL->VC; CarMaker is NOT on this bus). Channel 1 / IO614 Port B is the CarMaker bus (1280 CarMakerPedalDemand CarMaker->SpeedgoatHIL; 1281/1282 SpeedgoatHIL->CarMaker). The Speedgoat interprets CarMaker's pedal demand and republishes the per-inverter torque setpoints and ready bits CarMaker needs.";

NS_ :
    CM_
    BA_DEF_
    BA_
    BA_DEF_DEF_
    BU_SG_REL_
    BU_BO_REL_

BS_:

BU_: VC SpeedgoatHIL CarMaker

BO_ 390 Inverter1Control: 8 VC
