CM_ BO_ 1280 "Channel-1 CarMaker-bus frame. CRC-8/SAE-J1850 covers bytes 1..5: poly 0x1D, init 0xFF, RefIn=false, RefOut=false, xorout 0xFF. Exact ownership behavior is documented in VC_HIL/docs/can_pedal_demand_frame_spec.md.";
CM_ BO_ 1281 "Speedgoat-to-CarMaker telemetry, cyclic 5 ms, no application CRC, counter, or timeout.";
CM_ BO_ 1282 "Speedgoat-to-CarMaker telemetry, cyclic 5 ms. Reserved bits 4..63 must be zero. No application CRC, counter, or timeout.";
CM_ BO_ 52 "Confirmed ID only; signal layout is an open question and is retained as raw payload.";
CM_ BO_ 50 "Confirmed ID only; signal layout is an open question and is retained as raw payload.";
CM_ BO_ 688 "Confirmed ID only; signal layout is an open question and is retained as raw payload.";
